WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:09.679
Can you imagine?

2
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:16.286
I was flying above the clouds!

3
00:00:16.287 --> 00:00:18.173
Bada: This is boring.

4
00:00:18.174 --> 00:00:21.092
I thought flying would be fun.

5
00:00:21.093 --> 00:00:23.114
Mom: It's almost dinnertime.

6
00:00:23.115 --> 00:00:25.000
Here is the menu.

7
00:00:25.001 --> 00:00:30.933
Mom: We can have either salmon or chicken. Choose one.

8
00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:34.647
Hana: Hmm. I want chicken.

9
00:00:34.648 --> 00:00:37.104
Bada: What is salmon?

10
00:00:37.105 --> 00:00:39.555
Hana: It’s a kind of fish.

11
00:00:39.556 --> 00:00:42.422
Bada: Yuck! I hate fish.

12
00:00:42.423 --> 00:00:46.479
I will have chicken.

13
00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.435
Flight attendant: Salmon or chicken?

14
00:00:48.436 --> 00:00:50.458
Mom: Salmon, please.

15
00:00:50.459 --> 00:00:52.344
Hana: Chicken, please.

16
00:00:52.345 --> 00:00:58.639
Bada: Me too. Chicken, please.

17
00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.207
Flight attendant: Anything to drink?

18
00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:03.188
Mom: Yes, I will have some water.

19
00:01:03.189 --> 00:01:05.341
Hana: Do you have milk?

20
00:01:05.342 --> 00:01:06.684
Flight attendant: Sure, we do.

21
00:01:06.685 --> 00:01:10.447
Here you go.

22
00:01:10.448 --> 00:01:12.061
Hana: Thank you.

23
00:01:12.062 --> 00:01:15.029
Bada: Mom, can I have a Coke?

24
00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:17.685
Mom: Sorry, Bada. No Coke.

25
00:01:17.686 --> 00:01:22.387
Bada: Okay. Milk, please.

26
00:01:22.388 --> 00:01:24.789
It was a long flight.

27
00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.610
But I didn't mind.

28
00:01:26.611 --> 00:01:37.185
I will have so much fun soon.
